    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43151" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτεροῖ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτεροι-οίϊος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
			D.P.
			1180
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of a
				different kind, diverse</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.99
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἑ. οὐκ ἀλλοῖα</span>;
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prm.</u>
				161a
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί φαίνεται ἑτεροῖον
				διανοηθεὶς ὁ ἰητρὸς ἢ</span> . . ; <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. τινός</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>; <i>unusual, strange</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Po.</u>
					994
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				10
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οίως</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, διαιτηθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.219
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>diversified, differentiated</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόσμος,
				ἀριθμός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				194
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				204
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>different from what should be, untoward</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤν τι ἑ. ἀποβαίνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>JTr.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			.</div>
